// title: Resource Lock Deletion for Azure Monitor Rule
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Sentinel
// tables: AzureActivity
// purpose: Resource Lock Deletion for Azure Monitor Rule
// source: https://github.com/jkerai1/KQL-Queries/blob/829b34aea9fce1b50995ff348ee7be6b8eca34f3/Azure/Resource%20Lock%20Deletion%20for%20Azure%20Monitor%20Rule.kql
// kind: repo
